      "id": "0be262ce0634-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Acceleration is equal to the rate of change of ______. &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339;, ______ &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Acceleration is equal to the rate of change of ______.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339;, ______ &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Momentum &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2327;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Momentum</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2327;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Position &#2346;&#2367;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;/&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Position</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2367;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;/&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Displacement &#2357;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Displacement</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Velocity &#2357;&#2375;&#2327;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Velocity</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2375;&#2327;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Acceleration is the rate at which <b>velocity</b> changes. &#183; Acceleration can be caused by a change in the magnitude or the direction of the velocity, or both.</p>",
