      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which of the following equation of motion is correct? I. v = (u/2) + at II. s = 2ut + at2 &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;? I. v = (u/2) + at II. s = 2ut + at2",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following equation of motion is correct?</p><p>I. v = (u/2) + at</p><p>II. s = 2ut + at2</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>I. v = (u/2) + at</p><p>II. s = 2ut + at2</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only I</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; I</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Neither I nor II &#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Neither I nor II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Only II &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; II</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Both I and II I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Both I and II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Equation of motion:</p><p>&#183; v = u + at</p><p>&#183; v<sup>2</sup> = u<sup>2</sup> + 2as</p><p>&#183; s = ut + at<sup>2</sup>/2</p><p>Hence, neither I nor II is correct equation of motion.</p>",
