      "id": "0be262ce0634-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Identify the INCORRECT pair regarding motion and their examples. &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Identify the INCORRECT pair regarding motion and their examples.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Translatory motion - A ball falling from a cliff &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368;&#2351; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2375;&#2306;&#2342; &#2330;&#2335;&#2381;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2367;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Translatory motion  -  A ball falling from a cliff</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2368;&#2351; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2375;&#2306;&#2342; &#2330;&#2335;&#2381;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2367;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Periodic motion - Hands of a clock &#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2328;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2311;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Periodic motion  -  Hands of a clock</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2328;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2311;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Oscillatory motion - Earth moving around the Sun &#2342;&#2379;&#2354;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2346;&#2371;&#2341;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352; &#2328;&#2370;&#2350;&#2344;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Oscillatory motion  -  Earth moving around the Sun</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379;&#2354;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2346;&#2371;&#2341;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2323;&#2352; &#2328;&#2370;&#2350;&#2344;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Rotatory motion - Blades of a fan &#2328;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2346;&#2306;&#2326;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2337;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rotatory motion  -  Blades of a fan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2328;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; - &#2346;&#2306;&#2326;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2375;&#2337;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>&#183; Oscillatory motion involves back-and-forth movement (e.g., a pendulum).</p><p>&#183; The Earth moving around the Sun follows an elliptical orbit, which is an example of circular motion rather than oscillatory motion.</p>",
