    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "A bus moving on a straight road at a speed of 10 km/h increases its speed to 70 km/h in 2 minutes. Find its average acceleration. &#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2360; &#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2368; &#2360;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325; &#2346;&#2352; 10 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 2 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; 70 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>A bus moving on a straight road at a speed of 10 km/h increases its speed to 70 km/h in 2 minutes. Find its average acceleration.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2360; &#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2368; &#2360;&#2337;&#2364;&#2325; &#2346;&#2352; 10 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 2 &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; 70 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1 km/minute&#178; 1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1 km/minute&#178;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0.5 km/minute&#178; 0.5 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0.5 km/minute&#178;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2 km/minute&#178; 2 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2 km/minute&#178;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "30 km/minute&#178; 30 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">30 km/minute&#178;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">30 &#2325;&#2367;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335;&#178;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>&#8226; Initial velocity = 10 km/h, final velocity = 70 km/h, time = 2 minutes.</p><p>&#8226; Acceleration = (&#916;v / &#916;t) = (70 - 10) km/h / 2 min = 60 km/h / 2 min.</p><p>&#8226; Convert units: 60 km/h = 60/60 km/min = 1 km/min.</p><p>&#8226; Acceleration = 1 km/min / 2 min = 0.5 km/min&#178;.</p><p><b>Further Insight:</b></p><p>&#8226; Acceleration measures the rate of velocity change, critical in motion analysis.</p><p>&#8226; Formula for average acceleration: Average acceleration (a) is given by the formula: a = (&#916;v / &#916;t).</p><p>&#8226; The unit conversion ensures consistency, as km/min&#178; is appropriate given the time in minutes.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "A javelin thrown by an athlete is in ________ motion. &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2326;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2347;&#2375;&#2306;&#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2349;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; ________ &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>A javelin thrown by an athlete is in ________ motion.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2326;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2347;&#2375;&#2306;&#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2349;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; ________ &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Oscillatory oscillatory",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Oscillatory</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">oscillatory</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Periodic &#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Periodic</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Rectilinear &#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rectilinear</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2368;&#2343;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Curvilinear &#2357;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Curvilinear</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;&#2351;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>A javelin follows a curvilinear motion as it moves along a parabolic trajectory due to the combined effect of initial velocity and gravity.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "Which of the following is correct about uniform acceleration? &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is correct about uniform acceleration?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "An object moving on friction-less surface can gain uniform acceleration. &#2328;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2339; &#2352;&#2361;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2340;&#2361; &#2346;&#2352; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">An object moving on friction-less surface can gain uniform acceleration.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2328;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2339; &#2352;&#2361;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2340;&#2361; &#2346;&#2352; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "An object under free fall is an example of uniform acceleration. &#2350;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2361;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">An object under free fall is an example of uniform acceleration.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2369;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2361;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "An object moving with constant speed is an example of uniform acceleration. &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2352; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2368;&#2354; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">An object moving with constant speed is an example of uniform acceleration.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2352; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2368;&#2354; &#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Motion of a spring is an example of uniform acceleration. &#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Motion of a spring is an example of uniform acceleration.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>When an object is travelling in a straight line with an increase in velocity at equal intervals of time, then the object is said to be in uniform acceleration. Free falling of an object is an example of uniform acceleration.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "The motion of the body moving along a circular path is an example of _______. &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2341; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2342;&#2367;&#2358; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2367;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; _______ &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The motion of the body moving along a circular path is an example of _______.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2341; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2342;&#2367;&#2358; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2367;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367; _______ &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Decelerated motion &#2309;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Decelerated motion</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Accelerated motion &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Accelerated motion</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Non-uniform motion &#2309;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Non-uniform motion</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Uniform motion &#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Uniform motion</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325;&#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2327;&#2340;&#2367;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>When a body moves in a circular path, it is said to be in a circular motion. An object moving in a circular path may have constant speed. While the speed of the object is constant, its velocity is changing.</p><p>When the velocity of the object changes, we say that the object is accelerating. The change in the velocity could be due to change in its magnitude or the direction of the motion or both.</p><p>For example, if the athlete moves with a velocity of constant magnitude along the circular path, the only change in his velocity is due to the change in the direction of motion. The motion of the athlete moving along a circular path is, therefore, an example of an <b>accelerated motion.</b></p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0be262ce0634-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "If the uncertainty in position and momentum are equal, the uncertainty in velocity will be: &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2375;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the uncertainty in position and momentum are equal, the uncertainty in velocity will be:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2357;&#2375;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2375;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "&radic;h/&#960; &radic;h/&#960;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;h/&#960;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;h/&#960;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1/2m&radic;h/&#960; 1/2m&radic;h/&#960;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/2m&radic;h/&#960;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/2m&radic;h/&#960;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "&radic;h/2&#960; &radic;h/2&#960;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;h/2&#960;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;h/2&#960;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "&radic;h/2&#960;m &radic;h/2&#960;m",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;h/2&#960;m</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;h/2&#960;m</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>According to the Heisenberg Uncertainty Principle:</p><p>&#916;x. &#916;p &ge; h/4&#960;</p><p>&#916;x = Change in position</p><p>&#916;p = Change in momentum</p><p>&#916;p. &#916;p &ge; h/4&#960; [uncertainty in position and momentum are equal]</p><p>(m&#916;v)<sup>2</sup> &ge; h/4&#960;</p><p>&#916;v<sup>2</sup> &ge; 1/4m * h/&#960;</p><p>&#916;v &ge; 1/2m&radic;h/&#960;</p><p>Hence, option (b) is correct.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    }
